    "body": "The error message looks like it is caused because Starship can't get the data about your battery to display the battery module. A quick fix to stop the error message would be to disable the battery module, which can be done by running `starship config battery.disabled true`.\r\n\r\nSide note we should only display this message once per session it shouldn't be showing up every time we draw the prompt so there might be a bug somewhere in the logging setup.",
